tilo (0.6.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * The tab now grows into the picker instead of cross-fading into it, on the
    cubic bezier curves Windows 11 publishes rather than a named approximation.
  * Opening and closing wait for the pointer to mean it.
  * Every coordinate in the overlay is an integer, and neighbouring zones share
    their boundary exactly.

 -- Jeffrey Gbeho <jeff.gbeho@gmail.com>  Tue, 08 Sep 2026 18:49:24 -0400

tilo (0.5.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Touching the layout tab now opens the picker. It only responded within 24px
    of the screen edge, which is less than the tab's own height.

